{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Yumekuri","The story revolves around Yukami Makoto, a high school boy whose hobby is visiting hot springs. His 100th hot spring visit is at Miyama-kan, an inn run by four poster girls: Tokura, Akino, Tsutsuji and Mitomo. There, Makoto spies Yuri, a goddess of the hot springs, and unexpectedly usurps her powers. Makoto ends up working at the inn.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["ゆめくり",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-15535","ids":{"shikimori":15535,"mal":15535,"anilist":15535,"kodik":"movie-117883"},"kodikIds":["movie-47294","movie-48004","movie-117883"],"kodikRevisions":{"movie-47294":"2020-01-07T18:44:55Z","movie-48004":"2020-01-21T02:25:30Z","movie-117883":"2026-06-18T12:00:32Z"},"title":"Каштан мечты","originalTitle":"Yumekuri","alt":"Yume Kuri / ゆめくり ゆめくり","description":"История разворачивается вокруг старшеклассника Макото Юками, чьё хобби — посещение горячих источников. Его сотый визит состоялся в «Мияма-кан», гостинице, которую содержат четверо молодых девушек: Токура , Акино , Цуцудзи и Митомо . Здесь Макото встречает Юри , богиню горячих источников, которая неожиданно присваивает ему свои полномочия. Теперь Макото предстоит хорошенько потрудиться...","year":2012,"type":"OVA","genres":["сэйнэн","Повседневность"],"rating":5.41,"popularity":2495,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/15535/a64fa07e98b57d036af0d9ae6bea6da0.jpeg","width":456,"height":574},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/44779346eb2dfc4ea9d24c6a4fee8f16da389e66.png","width":852,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[1],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"movie-47294","translatio